    },
    "regime_notes": "Validation used the full available aligned cross-asset panel of exactly 15 tradable instruments. Recent 2028 YTD diagnostics were strong (5d IC/ICIR 0.112335/0.420919; 10d 0.191204/0.678792; 20d 0.235979/1.059736 over 108 observations), but uncertainty is material because the cross-section is small.",
